                    Name = "PSI Population Services International Madagascar",
                    PartnerShortDescription = "PSI Madagascar",
                    PartnerLongDescription = "PSI is a network of locally-led, globally-connected organizations that are\r\npassionate about making it easier for people to lead healthier lives.\r\nTogether with partners, we transform health by tackling the root causes\r\npreventing people and their communities from achieving\r\nand maintaining good, quality, and affordable health. We support\r\ngovernments in building resilient, people-centered, multi-channel health\r\nsystems that can adapt to health and climate shocks and support health\r\nworkforce development. We help grow robust markets to generate\r\ndemand, increase supply, and facilitate access to new and underused\r\nhealth products and services. We prioritize the voices of people and\r\ncommunities in designing programs, deliver direct-to-consumer products\r\nand information, and accelerate social and behavioral change for health\r\nimpact. Since its establishment in Madagascar in 1998, with support from\r\ndonors, private foundations, and local partners, PSI/Madagascar has\r\nworked in partnership with the Ministry of Public Health to improve the\r\nhealth of the Malagasy population.",
